  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: one-time nonce replay and use-after-free in\n     mod_auth_digest\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-73636_CVE-2026-73637.patch: accept a\n       one-time nonce or nonce-count only when it is newer than the one\n       last recorded for the client, and send a stale challenge when the\n       client entry is no longer known, in client_update_nonce() called\n       from check_and_record_nonce(); access client entries only while\n       holding client_lock, in modules/aaa/mod_auth_digest.c.\n       AuthDigestQop now accepts only \"auth\", and requests without\n       qop=auth are rejected.\n     - CVE-2026-73636\n     - CVE-2026-73637",
